[
  {
    "id": "jlp-testflow-herstart",
    "type": "tab",
    "label": "JLP · Testflow: herstart aanvragen",
    "disabled": true,
    "info": "versie 1.1.0\n\nStaat standaard UIT. Vraagt bij de Hub een herstart van één app aan als ActionProposal (contract 1.3 §8). De flow voert zelf niets uit: de Hub bepaalt de risicoklasse, vraagt zo nodig goedkeuring en laat alleen de uitvoerder iets doen. Het antwoord toont de status (toegestaan of wacht op goedkeuring). Volgt geen doorverwijzingen (msg.followRedirects = false): het token gaat alleen naar HUB_URL."
  },
  {
    "id": "jlp-th-start",
    "type": "inject",
    "z": "jlp-testflow-herstart",
    "name": "vraag herstart aan (handmatig)",
    "props": [
      {
        "p": "payload"
      }
    ],
    "repeat": "",
    "crontab": "",
    "once": false,
    "onceDelay": "5",
    "topic": "",
    "payload": "{\"doel_app\":\"node-red\"}",
    "payloadType": "json",
    "x": 180,
    "y": 80,
    "wires": [
      [
        "jlp-th-bouw"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "jlp-th-bouw",
    "type": "change",
    "z": "jlp-testflow-herstart",
    "name": "voorstel (§8)",
    "rules": [
      {
        "t": "set",
        "p": "payload",
        "pt": "msg",
        "to": "(\n  $hex := function($n) { $pad($formatBase($floor($random() * $power(16, $n)), 16), -$n, \"0\") };\n  $uuid := function() { $hex(8) & \"-\" & $hex(4) & \"-4\" & $hex(3) & \"-\" & $substring(\"89ab\", $floor($random() * 4), 1) & $hex(3) & \"-\" & $hex(12) };\n  {\n    \"idempotency_key\": $uuid(),\n    \"action_id\": \"app.restart\",\n    \"target\": {\"app_id\": payload.doel_app},\n    \"parameters\": {},\n    \"reason\": \"Testflow uit Node-RED: herstart aanvragen via de Hub (I10-10-04).\",\n    \"actor\": {\"type\": \"flow\", \"id\": \"testflow-herstart\"},\n    \"expires_in_seconds\": 300\n  }\n)",
        "tot": "jsonata"
      },
      {
        "t": "set",
        "p": "url",
        "pt": "msg",
        "to": "$env('HUB_URL') & '/api/v1/actions/proposals'",
        "tot": "jsonata"
      },
      {
        "t": "set",
        "p": "followRedirects",
        "pt": "msg",
        "to": "false",
        "tot": "bool"
      }
    ],
    "action": "",
    "property": "",
    "from": "",
    "to": "",
    "reg": false,
    "x": 420,
    "y": 80,
    "wires": [
      [
        "jlp-th-stuur"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "jlp-th-stuur",
    "type": "http request",
    "z": "jlp-testflow-herstart",
    "name": "POST voorstel",
    "method": "POST",
    "ret": "obj",
    "paytoqs": "ignore",
    "url": "",
    "tls": "",
    "persist": false,
    "proxy": "",
    "insecureHTTPParser": false,
    "authType": "bearer",
    "senderr": false,
    "headers": [],
    "x": 620,
    "y": 80,
    "wires": [
      [
        "jlp-th-toon"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "jlp-th-toon",
    "type": "debug",
    "z": "jlp-testflow-herstart",
    "name": "besluit van de Hub",
    "active": true,
    "tosidebar": true,
    "console": false,
    "tostatus": false,
    "complete": "payload",
    "targetType": "msg",
    "statusVal": "",
    "statusType": "auto",
    "x": 840,
    "y": 80,
    "wires": []
  },
  {
    "id": "jlp-th-fout",
    "type": "catch",
    "z": "jlp-testflow-herstart",
    "name": "fouten in deze flow",
    "scope": null,
    "uncaught": false,
    "x": 150,
    "y": 160,
    "wires": [
      [
        "jlp-th-fouttoon"
      ]
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "jlp-th-fouttoon",
    "type": "debug",
    "z": "jlp-testflow-herstart",
    "name": "fout",
    "active": true,
